accTitle: Returning an item
accDescr: The customer finds the order, chooses the item, prints a return label, drops off the parcel and receives the refund. If interrupted before printing, the return is saved and the customer resumes from an email link.
Find[Find the order] --> Choose[Choose item and reason]
Choose --> Label[Print return label]
Choose -->|interrupted| Saved[Return saved]
Saved -->|email link| Choose
Label --> Drop[Drop off parcel]
Drop --> Refund[Refund received]

